4.
Constitution of Board.
(1)
The Board shall consist of the following members, namely :-
A - Ex-officio members
(i)
Minister having the charge of law, Madhya Pradesh;
[(i-a) State Minister tor Law, if any;
[Inserted by M.P. Act No. 26 of 1986.]
(i-b) Executive Chairman;]
[(i-c) Honorary Deputy Chairman]
[Inserted by M.P. Act No. 16 of 1991.]
;
(ii)
Advocate General, Madhya Pradesh;
(iii)
Secretary to Government of Madhya Pradesh Law and Legislative Affairs Department;
(iv)
Secretary to the Government of Madhya Pradesh, Finance Department;
